## Dev vs Prod Configuration Gap (noted during investigation, not yet acted on)

| Setting | Dev | Prod |
|---|---|---|
| `PROXMOX_NODE` | `pve-dev` | `pve-prod` |
| `CONFIRM_DELAY` | 180s (3 min, double-checks suspect nodes before acting) | **missing — acts immediately on first failure** |
| `NODE_MAP` | 2 workers | 3 workers |
| Escalation path | reboot → reset → exhausted | reboot → reset → restore from backup → exhausted |

Prod is structurally more aggressive (no confirmation phase) than dev despite being the higher-stakes environment. Flagged as a standing risk, separate from this incident.

